# Pipeline-generated data artifacts (CSV/TSV/JSON/FASTA/parquet under data/)
# must be checked out byte-for-byte identical to what's committed, on every
# platform and git config. core.autocrlf=true (common on Windows) otherwise
# silently rewrites LF -> CRLF in the working tree on checkout, which breaks
# every SHA-256 checksum the FR1 freeze mechanism (curation/freeze.py) and
# reproducibility tests depend on, without changing what's actually stored.
# See IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md decision log, 2026-10-14.
data/** -text
